CRITICAL NOTICE: ADVISORY DECISION SUPPORT & NOTIONAL DATA STATEMENT
================================================================================
The system provides advisory decision support only. A human approves every change.
It contains no targeting, weapon-employment, or autonomous-engagement logic.
All data is synthetic and notional.
================================================================================

1. UNCLASSIFIED & NOTIONAL NATURE:
   All geographic deployments, aircraft tail numbers, pilot callsigns, radar
   frequencies, radar threat envelopes, weapon loadout tables, munition types,
   and operational parameters in this repository are entirely NOTIONAL, SYNTHETIC,
   and UNCLASSIFIED.

2. ZERO ACCESS TO CLASSIFIED ASSETS:
   This project was developed without access to any classified military documentation,
   defense data links, operational tactical codes, or proprietary defense communication
   systems. Any resemblance to real operational deployments, squadron callsigns, or
   wartime target lists is purely coincidental.

3. INTENDED PURPOSE:
   This software is an academic demonstration and proof-of-concept algorithmic
   decision-support system built for competition evaluation in Smart India Hackathon
   2026. It is designed to illustrate Operations Research optimization, discrete-event
   simulation, explainable AI, and human-in-the-loop doctrine.

